1. Added mock organization data that matches the expected shape of the OrgBrandingProvider context
2. Passed the mock data to OrgBrandingProvider as props
3. Included all necessary fields that the provider might expect (id, slug, name, logoUrl, brandColor, darkBrandColor, theme)
4. Set isLoading to false to indicate the data is ready

This should resolve the context error by providing the necessary organization branding data that the hook expects. The mock data follows the expected structure of an organization in the Cal.com system.

